%% Figura 4.3 — Flujo de petición autenticada
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Cliente (Navegador)
  participant V as Vercel
  participant R as Render (requireAuth)
  participant A as AsyncLocalStorage
  participant S as Supabase (tenant)

  C->>V: GET / (HTML+JS)
  V-->>C: Bundle estático
  C->>R: POST /api/auth/login<br/>{username, password}<br/>x-tenant-id: market
  R->>S: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username=$1
  S-->>R: row + bcrypt hash
  R-->>C: JWT { sub, role, tenant }<br/>exp 12h
  C->>R: GET /api/clients<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>x-tenant-id: market
  R->>A: verify(JWT) → tenant=market<br/>run(callback)
  A->>S: pool[market].query(...)<br/>SSL
  S-->>C: JSON respuesta
